 Technologies Used

 🐍 Python - Core Programming Language

 📡 APIs Used:
1. OpenWeatherMap API (`https://api.openweathermap.org`)
   - Forecast endpoint: Gets 3-hour interval weather predictions
   - Current weather endpoint: Gets real-time weather conditions
   - Requires API key (APPID)

2. Sunrise-Sunset API (`http://api.sunrise-sunset.org`)
   - Gets sunrise/sunset times for your location
   - Used to determine if it's day or night for appropriate icons

 📧 Email System:
- smtplib: Python's built-in SMTP library for sending emails
- EmailMessage: For constructing multi-part email messages
- Gmail SMTP: `smtp.gmail.com` as the email service provider
- HTML & CSS: For creating visually appealing email templates
- Base64 encoding: For embedding images (if using local images)

 🔐 Security:
- Environment variables: Sensitive data stored securely
  - `MY_EMAIL`: Your email address
  - `PASSWORD`: Your email password (app password for Gmail)
  - `APPID`: OpenWeatherMap API key

 🕐 Time Handling:
- datetime: For date/time operations
- pytz: For timezone handling (Europe/Berlin/CEST)
- UTC: For standard time reference

 🔧 Additional Libraries:
- requests: For making HTTP API calls
- os: For accessing environment variables
- json: For parsing API responses

