 Simple Explanation

Think of it as your personal weather assistant that:
- Checks the weather automatically every day
- Sends you a beautifully formatted email with the forecast
- Tells you what to wear and whether to bring an umbrella
- Runs completely in the background (can be automated with GitHub Actions)

No manual checking needed - it does everything for you and delivers the information straight to your inbox!
